Abstract
Project Title:

OTT Content Analytics and Recommendation System Using Python

Project Description (10 Lines):

The project focuses on analyzing OTT platform content using Python-based data analytics techniques.
It combines datasets from multiple platforms such as Netflix, Prime Video, and Disney+ to understand content trends.
The system analyzes movies and TV shows based on genre, ratings, release year, language, and popularity.
Data cleaning and preprocessing techniques are applied to improve dataset quality.
Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA) is performed to identify patterns and trends in OTT content.
A recommendation system is developed to suggest suitable content based on user preferences.
Sentiment analysis is performed on user reviews to understand audience opinions.
Machine learning techniques are used for genre trend and popularity prediction.
Data visualization techniques represent insights through charts and graphs.
The final system helps OTT platforms understand viewer behavior and improve content recommendations.

